        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gallagher Quigley are delighted to present this bright and well-proportioned one-bedroom apartment, ideally positioned on the fourth floor of the popular Corn Mill development.\r\n\r\nExtending to c.470 sqft / 43.7m2, the accommodation comprises an entrance hall with storage, a spacious open-plan living and dining room with kitchen off, a generous double size bedroom with built-in wardrobes and a bathroom with bath and overhead shower.\r\n\r\nThe living/dining area benefits from excellent natural light and opens onto a private balcony enjoying attractive views towards Croke Park and the surrounding city skyline. The kitchen features contemporary units with integrated appliances and polished granite countertop. \r\n\r\nThe apartment is presented in good condition throughout and further benefits from electric heating, double-glazed windows, lift access and a designated car-parking space.\r\n\r\nBuilt in 2007, Corn Mill is a well-maintained residential development with attractive landscaped communal areas. The property is conveniently located just off Clonliffe Road and within walking distance of Drumcondra village, Drumcondra Railway Station, Croke Park, local shops, cafés and restaurants. Dublin city centre, the Mater Hospital, DCU and Dublin Airport are also easily accessible."
      },
